{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 16, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt embark on a journey to the land of the rising sun, Japan.\n\nIn the grand city of Tokyo, thou shalt begin thy adventure. Visit the Sensoji Temple and marvel at its ancient beauty. Then, proceed to the Meiji Shrine, where the spirit of Emperor Meiji resides.\n\nThe following day, explore the bustling streets of Harajuku and Shibuya, where fashion and pop culture reign supreme. In the evening, witness the breathtaking view of the city from atop the Tokyo Skytree.\n\nOn the third day, journey to the historic city of Kyoto. Visit the Kinkakuji Temple, a golden pavilion that reflects upon the mirror-like waters of its surrounding pond. Then, make thy way to the Fushimi Inari Shrine, where thou shalt be greeted by thousands of vermilion torii gates.\n\nThe following day, embark on a scenic train ride to Hakone, where thou shalt indulge in the natural beauty of the Hot Springs Valley. Take a cruise upon the serene waters of Lake Ashi and behold the majestic view of Mount Fuji.\n\nThy final day in Japan shall be spent in the vibrant city of Osaka. Stroll through the Dotonbori district and indulge in the local cuisine. Visit the Osaka Castle, a symbol of Japan's unification, and reflect upon the memories of thy journey.\n\nAnd thus, thy itinerary is complete. May it guide thee on a marvelous adventure through the wondrous land of Japan.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.308956116437912}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.021099278703331947}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -0.725500226020813}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -2.50339189733495e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.02675713784992695}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0004880429187323898}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.021917853504419327}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0024365282151848078}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token